      }
    ],
    "status": "present",
    "value": "Grants as in GPU Credits (unique ids, closed windows, out-of-order arrival). The state at time t is defined by replaying all received consumptions with timestamp <= t in (timestamp, arrival) order against the received grants. A consumption at time c succeeds only if the remaining amount of grants active at c is >= amount; it then draws from active grants in order of earliest endTime, then earliest startTime, then creditId ascending; a failing consumption has no effect. consumeCredit returns whether it succeeds in the replay of events received so far (later-arriving earlier events may change later answers). getBalance(t) is the remaining amount of grants active at t after that replay."
  },
